ready for collection, the borrower is notified by email\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"When a reserved item arrives, a hold slip is printed and folded into the item so the name is visible from the spine.\",\n      \"line\": 9,\n      \"span\": \"When a reserved item arrives, print a hold slip and fold it into the item so the name is visible from the spine\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Items are shelved alphabetically by the borrower's surname.\",\n      \"line\": 9,\n      \"span\": \"Shelve items alphabetically by the borrower's surname\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"A reserved item waits on the hold shelf for 7 days from when the borrower is notified.\",\n      \"line\": 13,\n      \"span\": \"A reserved item waits on the hold shelf for 7 days from when the borrower is notified\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Day one is the notification day, not the arrival day.\",\n      \"line\": 13,\n      \"span\": \"day one is the notification day, not the arrival day\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The shelf is swept every morning before opening.\",\n      \"line\": 17,\n      \"span\": \"Sweep the shelf every morning before opening\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Items not collected within 7 days go back into circulation.\",\n      \"line\": 17,\n      \"span\": \"Items not collected within 7 days go back into circulation\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Items not collected within 7 days move to the next borrower in the queue if there is one.\",\n      \"line\": 17,\n      \"span\": \"move to the next borrower in the queue if there is one\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"If a borrower cannot collect within 7 days, they can request a 7-day extension before the deadline expires.\",\n      \"line\": 21,\n      \"span\": \"If a borrower cannot collect within 7 days, they can request a 7-day extension before the deadline expires\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The extension is granted once per reservation.\",\n      \"line\": 21,\n      \"span\": \"This extension is granted once per reservation\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"If an item remains uncollected after being held twice, the item goes back to the shelves.\",\n      \"line\": 25,\n      \"span\": \"If an item remains uncollected after being held twice, it goes back to the shelves\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"If an item remains uncollected after being held twice, the reservation is cancelled.\",\n      \"line\": 25,\n      \"span\": \"the reservation is cancelled\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The borrower must place a new reservation if they wish to request the item again.\",\n      \"line\": 25,\n      \"span\": \"The borrower must place a new reservation if they wish to request the item again\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```","ttft_ms":69362,"type":"result","duration_ms":72985,"uuid":"27b8637f-d7e3-4cbe-86b1-3672dd4c3d52","ttft_stream_ms":1482,"time_to_request_ms":110,"first_content_frame_ms":1483,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
